# Tiger's Teeth (sandoria 23): Taumila in Southern San d'Oria. The guard (fame level 3): a trade while available
# (nothing), fame level 2 (her default TAUMILA_DIALOG), the offer 574 declined (not option 0: nothing) and taken, the
# accepted 575 (replaceDefault), the wrong trades (573 each), 572 for exactly three Black Tiger Fangs (completed: 2100
# gil, Fang Finder, no fame: the reward has no fameArea; the fangs taken), the completed 571, a wrong trade (573), and the
# repeat (Option 1, 572: 2100 gil, fame +16, the fangs taken, Option 0). Taumila has no script; no other quest names her.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Taumila/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Taumila/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/574 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/572
warning: quests: sandoria.tigers_teeth: one finish of 572 ran 2 handlers (2/-/onEventFinish:572, 3/-/onEventFinish:572) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at Tigers_Teeth.lua:61 (accepted) and :92 (completed) at lua-at 134c87af hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-138.3,-6,-9.7
fame Sandoria 124
item BlackTigerFang x6
item BoneChip
login
trade Taumila BlackTigerFang x3           # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Taumila                           # fame level 2: her default text TAUMILA_DIALOG
finish-if-event
fame Sandoria 125
trigger Taumila                           # fame level 3: 574
finish option=1                           # not option 0: nothing
trigger Taumila                           # 574
finish                                    # option 0: begun
trigger Taumila                           # accepted: 575 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Taumila BoneChip x1                 # not the fangs: 573
finish
trade Taumila BlackTigerFang x2           # two: 573
finish
trade Taumila BlackTigerFang x3 BoneChip x1   # not exactly three: 573
finish
trade Taumila BlackTigerFang x3           # exactly three: 572
finish                                    # completed: 2100 gil, Fang Finder, no fame; the fangs taken
trigger Taumila                           # completed: 571 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Taumila BoneChip x1                 # completed, not the fangs: 573
finish
trade Taumila BlackTigerFang x3           # completed, exactly three: Option 1, 572
finish                                    # Option 1: 2100 gil, Option 0, the fangs taken, fame +16
